      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Great question! Yes this is inherited from llama.cpp as noted in the Acknowledge section, we had pushed our model support code into llama.cpp via https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp/pull/7931, however there are some framework refinements in bitnet.cpp that have hard conflicts with original llama.cpp code, so that a new repo might be needed. \nComparing to llama.cpp, bitnet.cpp's inference result is exact the same as the \"ground truth\" one, we will add more explanations in the Readme file later, thanks.  ",
